        "defaultValue": "Water and food"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Each meter drains while you're awake: quickly down to 50%, where the watch buzzes, then much more slowly. To log a drink or a meal, shake your wrist to open the picker, shake again to step through the amounts, then hold still for a few seconds to log the one showing. How far a cup or a meal refills the bar comes from the details under About you."
